.TH EGGHEAD-MCP 1 "April 2026" "egghead 0.1.0" "Egghead Manual"
.SH NAME
egghead-mcp \- MCP stdio server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B egghead mcp
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR PATH ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start the MCP stdio server. Reads JSON-RPC messages from stdin and
writes responses to stdout. Used by editor integrations like Claude
Code via
.IR .mcp.json .
.PP
For the HTTP MCP endpoint, use
.BR egghead-serve (1)
(available at /mcp on the web port).
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-config \fIPATH\fR
Override config file location.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help text.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR egghead-serve (1),
.BR egghead (1)
